 },
 "rules": [
  "supervision: local-learning-supervision v1 condition IB unchanged (B1, B6x ascending A, B7x ascending B)",
  "blocks (w_1A,w_2A),(w_1B,w_2B),(w_KA,w_KB),(w_12); N1 = 26 single-block edits (v1 order); N2 = 240 edits changing exactly two blocks; N<=2 = N1 + N2",
  "loss: sum over keys of |predicted symmetric-difference feedback| after projection; unit weight per element",
  "B0/SCOPE/REPEAT tie-break: (current loss, changed coefficients, lexicographic vector); commit on strict improvement",
  "SCOPE: candidates unchanged + N1 + N2 (267); REPEAT: repeat the B0 decision until no strict improvement; cost 27 x (commits + 1)",
  "REPLAY: eligible = N1 edits strictly improving the current map (commit iff B0 would at that state); select by (summed loss over stored earlier maps, current loss, changed, lexicographic); all 27 candidates scored on every stored map; current map appended after the decision",
  "previously correct items: earlier training items reproduced on the own map by the state before the decision",
  "failing experience: after the experience the current example is not exact, or an item correct at its start is broken",
  "d(w): blocks differing from the nearer of teacher and core-sign mirror; G-down/G-le: N1 edges with strictly decreasing / non-increasing frozen-example loss; reachability by exact reverse BFS from the teacher class",
  "cost units: candidate vectors evaluated, (candidate, key) predictions, history predictions, decisions, commits, coefficients changed, simulation requests (total, unique), stored maps",
  "targets L1-L3 as local-learning-supervision v1 at checkpoint 15, raw-count pooling over 25 streams"
 ],
